# Project Conventions

This repo is `fe/` (Vite PWA) + `be/` (NestJS). Client-specific architecture lives in each app's `.cursor/rules`. Shared process rules always apply here.

## Confirm before changing files (G3)
List every create/modify/delete and wait for confirmation.

## Conventional Commits (S9)
`feat:` / `fix:` / `chore:` / … — `hook-commit-guard` enforces this.

## No Hardcoded Secrets (H6)
`hook-protect-env` blocks `.env` (allows `.env.example`). `hook-secret-scan` blocks secret literals in source.

## Package Install Approval (H7)
`npm install <package>` requires approval.

## PWA never caches `/api/*`
Workbox `NetworkOnly` for all API routes, especially `/api/auth/*`.

## Automated Hooks (G2)
Do not bypass. Format/lint runs in `fe/` (eslint) or `be/` (oxlint) based on the edited file path.
